### Invite User using Federation Server (maybe duplicate of https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/5822)

I've set up a two Synapse servers. Both servers works just fine. Trying to invite a user from one homeserver to other one is failing with a 401 Unauthorized error.

```
2019-08-16 11:04:44,991 - synapse.http.matrixfederationclient - 436 - INFO - POST-11 - {GET-O-2}  Got response headers: 401 Unauthorized
2019-08-16 11:04:44,992 - synapse.http.matrixfederationclient - 520 - WARNING - POST-11 - {GET-O-2} Request failed: GET matrix://<destinationserver>/_matrix/federation/v1/query/profile?user_id=<userid>&field=displayname: HttpResponseException("401: b'Unauthorized'",)
2019-08-16 11:04:44,993 - synapse.handlers.message - 350 - INFO - POST-11 - Failed to get profile information for <userid>: 401: No key for **originserver** with ids in ['ed25519:a_gnHf'] (min_validity 1565967852386)
```

Checking the keys for the origin server, using postman GET
`https://<originserver>/_matrix/key/v2/server` the result is

```
{
    "old_verify_keys": {},
    "server_name": "originserver",
    "signatures": {
        "originserver": {
            "ed25519:a_gnHf": "IpHrGIj46ZW8uFi3yUsX1CGXo7YxWjwW92/BlJmHg86gblf3D33AwWKCUxaxVzgkkzKDblYtm875iSQOrfWOCw"
        }
    },
    "tls_fingerprints": [
        {
            "sha256": "IvP9UqGYIEq2SE/EWAawOWunXvOR83ssD2PWr4u/uYA"
        }
    ],
    "valid_until_ts": 1566054234445,
    "verify_keys": {
        "ed25519:a_gnHf": {
            "key": "/P/XRcwCdrY5t+5Fm01Eb5gSMhEHFqj77jYT/EQEDbo"
        }
    }
}

```
So the origin server has key **ed25519:a_gnHf**.

Trying to invoke the same on Postman 
`GET https://destinationserver/_matrix/federation/v1/query/profile?user_id=<userid>&field=displayname
Authorization: X-Matrix origin=originserver,key=ed25519:a_gnHf,sig="somethinghere"`

The result is

```
{
    "errcode": "M_UNAUTHORIZED",
    "error": "No key for originserver with ids in ['ed25519:a_gnHf'] (min_validity 1565970456478)"
}
```
Synapse Version Origin: 1.2.1
Synapse Version Destination: 1.0.0

Can anyone help me here?

Thanks
